§cToday's warp is for any aspiring writers out there!

Located at /warp mall, this cute library shop is perfect for your book-ish needs. Affordable books, book & quills, books...
#- §cmore books, books & bookshelves.... and a great selection of actual books that you can take home and read to your heart's content. My personal favourite is: 

     ❤§4The Lusty§c❤ 
   ❤§4Argonian Maid§c❤ 

One of the classics if I do say so myself!
#- §cIt takes a lot of time and effort to recreate books (trust me I know) so credit for this hard work is a must! Well done!
I'm looking forward to the other literature to come.

